{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37742","headline":"寄献狄右丞 · 郑谷","name":"寄献狄右丞","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"逐胜偷闲向杜陵，爱僧不爱紫衣僧。\n身爲醉客思吟客，官自中丞拜右丞。\n残月露垂朝阙盖，落花风动宿斋灯。\n孤单小谏渔舟在，心恋清潭去未能。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"郑谷","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_37742.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37742","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}